[h1]Artel Manufactory — French translation[/h1]
French text translation for Artel Manufactory 0.2.0 on Project Zomboid Build 42.21: items, recipes, menus, machines, dialogues, tooltips and sandbox options.
Requires [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3794133594]Artel Manufactory[/url]. Enable both mods, load this translation after the original, and select French in the game options.
An independent language module containing no gameplay code from the original mod.

